<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with us regarding your seating allocation on your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If dissatisfied with seating general:</strong></em><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear you were dissatisfied on this occasion. Seating allocation for our flights is open on qantas.com from 350 days prior to each flight departure. This means if customers wait until check in, there are often limited seats left for allocation.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If split seating add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to learn that we were unable to seat you and your -wife/family/son etc- next to each other on your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Seating allocation for our flights is open on qantas.com, from 350 days prior to each flight departure. This means if customers wait until they arrive at the airport to request their seats it can be difficult for our check-in staff to provide multiple seats together, especially where the flight is full.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not provided pre-selected seat add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear we were unable to provide you the seat requested on your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
While we try to meet every customer’s seating preference, even when you have a pre-allocated seat, we sometimes need to rearrange seating for security or operational reasons. We do our best to re-book you to a seat similar to the one you held.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not provided FF profile preference add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear we were unable to allocate a seat matching your preference in your Frequent Flyer profile for flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Seating allocation for our flights is open on qantas.com from 350 days prior to each flight departure. If you haven't selected a particular seat prior to check-in, our check-in system will offer you the best match to your preference available at that time.<br />
<br />
However, as most customers have already chosen their seat by this time, seating options may be limited. To avoid this occurring in future, you may wish to select a seat at the time of booking or prior to check-in opening.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>